	"URL": "https://github.com/alialomari-coder/Awqati/releases/download/v8.2.1/awqati-8.2.1.nvda-addon",
	"description": "Awqati provides prayer times, along with sunrise, midnight and the start of the last third of the night; a clock with Zawali and Ghurubi time; and five calendars: Gregorian, Lunar Hijri and three Solar Hijri calendars. It also provides daily astronomical information and information from the traditional Arabian calendar, including Talaa periods, seasons and the Suhail year.\n\nThe add-on offers reminders for daily Wird and adhkar, information about the Qibla direction, quiet hours, and control over prayer-time alerts and alerts before and after those times.\n\nIt includes four time management tools: alarms, a stopwatch, countdown timers and a world clock, with dedicated keyboard shortcuts for controlling them and checking their status.\n\nIt includes On This Day information from Wikipedia, in Arabic and English, with direct narration and accessible web pages. The add-on supports Arabic and English.",
	"sha256": "ad925257005d160315bf30069fd5f51da44b103d36b5ef86f430838075db2851",
